  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed use of the outbuilding for the operation as a beauty treatment room&amp;nbsp;between the hours of 10am to 5pm Mondays to Fridays and 10am to 1pm Saturdays, by appointment only for one client at any one time and for no more than 5 clients a day, does not does not result in a material change of use from Use Class C3 (Residential). The use would therefore constitute lawful development as defined by section 192(1)&amp;nbsp;of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&amp;nbsp;The proposal is\r\ntherefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
